{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>泰國人氣cafe食得嘅果醬玻璃樽</p><p>泰國曼谷人氣咖啡店 最近推出話題甜品「The Picnic Basket」野餐籃芝士蛋糕，最令人驚喜的是蛋糕附送的「果醬玻璃樽」都食得！由可食用材質製成，質地類似啫喱或軟糖，樽內裝滿酸甜濃郁的莓果醬，享用時可以親手將果醬淋在芝士蛋糕上，儀式感十足；倒完果醬後，連同「玻璃樽」也可以吃，玩味十足，難怪在社交平台引起熱議。</p><p>Unbirthday Cafe 地址：2/F, Mapengseng Apartment, 14 Sukhumvit 31, Bangkok 營業時間：08:30 – 19:00</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178773909507616237_7742640406a8ebbd81f577.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/17877390973321957_18889505886a8ebbda1c16d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178773909996617889_15785961206a8ebbdc78aa7.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178773910156453814_21244043926a8ebbde3c353.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-26T10:19:51.612634+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":333,"images":4,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}